  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: P\u0131narba\u015f\u0131</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Ancient springs, mentioned by Livy in his account of the military campaign of Gnaeus Manlius Vulso (consul of 189 BCE) in \"Gallograecia\" in Asia Minor. Scholars identify these \"fontes\" with the water source (P\u0131narba\u015f\u0131) feeding the modern Karakuyu/\u00c7apal\u0131 G\u00f6l\u00fc in Turkey's Afyonkarahisar province.",
